{"title":"Pan African Mathematics Olympiad","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Pan African Mathematics Olympiad (PAMO)</b> is a math Olympiad for African students under 20 years old.  Around 35 countries are involved in the competition.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Structure\">Structure</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pan_African_Mathematics_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Structure\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are a total of six problems spread over two days.  Each day, solvers have 4.5 hours to solve three problems.  Each problem is worth 7 points.  The topics covered in the problems are at pre-university level.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pan_African_Mathematics_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pan_African_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Pan African MO Problems and Solutions\">Pan African MO Problems and Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://pamo-official.org/en/index.php\">Official Website</a>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://pamo-official.org/en/opam_archives_problemes.php\">Past Problems</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3228_pan_african\">AoPS Community</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Pan_African_Mathematics_Olympiad&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018082824\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.012 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 12/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 337/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.338      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.338      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:17695:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018082824 and revision id 110358. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}